Patch 0041 (vp34, ported from Strikers 0045 + 0051 + 0061 + Carbon S7, GXV_VGL_WRCOPY / GXV_VGL_TEXCOPY_DMA):
NEON/vstm/DMA write-combining copies into uncached stream & uniform pools (with mode 3 DMA -> mode 1 NEON fallback)
and DMA engine contiguous linear texture uploads (source/utils/wrcopy.{c,h}). Default mode 0 (inert until enabled by host).
